{"title": "The sellers' trap", "type": "Big players", "hooks": ["It broke the lows and looked finished. Sellers who jumped in got caught.", "It looked like a breakdown, until the price came back for the sellers.", "This breakdown trapped every seller who chased it."], "scenes": [{"kind": "hook", "vo": "It broke the lows and looked finished. Sellers who jumped in got caught.", "text": "The sellers' trap", "chart": 0, "win": [20, 115], "show": 90}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 0, "head": "Where the stops sat", "show": 36, "vo": "CareRx Pharmacy, hourly. It made lows at 9.18, then 8.67. Buyers' stops sat just under them.", "cues": [{"say": "9.18", "do": "mark", "i": 38, "label": "A", "side": "low", "tone": "amber"}, {"say": "then 8.67", "do": "mark", "i": 53, "label": "B", "side": "low", "tone": "amber"}, {"say": "just under them", "do": "line", "price": 8.67, "label": "Stops below", "tone": "red"}], "win": [20, 115]}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 0, "head": "The push down", "show": 53, "vo": "Then it dropped to 7.98. Those stops fired, and new sellers chased the breakdown.", "cues": [{"say": "dropped to 7.98", "do": "reveal", "to": 59}, {"say": "chased the breakdown", "do": "mark", "i": 59, "label": "C", "side": "low", "tone": "red"}], "win": [20, 115]}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 0, "head": "The turn", "show": 59, "vo": "But it climbed back, and closed through resistance at 9.67. Twenty-five candles later, it was 13.4 percent higher.", "cues": [{"say": "resistance at 9.67", "do": "line", "price": 9.67, "label": "Resistance", "tone": "teal"}, {"say": "Twenty-five candles later", "do": "reveal", "to": 115}], "win": [20, 115]}, {"kind": "big", "text": "Wait for the close to hold", "vo": "A break below an obvious low is where stops live. Wait to see if the close holds before you chase it.", "chart": null}, {"kind": "outro", "text": "Spot the trap yourself", "vo": "Follow for more, and practise spotting traps with practice money at memestreet.net.", "chart": null}], "caption"